{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0008-s002", "text": "Det är viktigt att personen känner till sina rättigheter och skyldigheter i Finland.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-integration/narration/resume-20261103T063708681338+0000-4/hb-c12-u0008-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.035646258503402, "peak": 0.296173095703125, "generation_seconds": 23.977263202890754, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0008-s003", "text": "Det är också bra att känna till Finlands historia och veta hurdana lagar och seder det finns i Finland och varför.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-integration/narration/resume-20261103T063708681338+0000-4/hb-c12-u0008-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.613061224489796, "peak": 0.37591552734375, "generation_seconds": 25.012936796061695, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0009-s001", "text": "Integration betyder också att personen betraktar Finland som en viktig del av sitt liv och sin framtid och känner samhörighet med finländarna.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-integration/narration/resume-20261103T063708681338+0000-4/hb-c12-u0009-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 11.77251700680272, "peak": 0.371978759765625, "generation_seconds": 29.767551961820573, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0009-s002", "text": "Hen har hittat sin plats i samhället och har byggt sociala nätverk.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-integration/narration/resume-20261103T063708681338+0000-4/hb-c12-u0009-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.851428571428571, "peak": 0.309295654296875, "generation_seconds": 14.318063508952036, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0009-s003", "text": "Om personen vill kan hen vara aktiv i sina gemenskaper eller till exempel inom politiken.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-integration/narration/resume-20261103T063708681338+0000-4/hb-c12-u0009-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.010884353741497, "peak": 0.429443359375, "generation_seconds": 20.94792692991905, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0010-s001", "text": "Också det omgivande samhällets mottaglighet har betydelse för känslan av delaktighet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-integration/narration/resume-20261103T063708681338+0000-4/hb-c12-u0010-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.174965986394557, "peak": 0.36395263671875, "generation_seconds": 17.747109869029373, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0011-s001", "text": "Integration i Finland kräver att den nyanlända anpassar sig och tar till sig nya kunskaper och färdigheter.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-integration/narration/resume-20261103T063708681338+0000-4/hb-c12-u0011-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.47374149659864, "peak": 0.385528564453125, "generation_seconds": 27.425579207018018, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0011-s002", "text": "Samtidigt måste också de som bor i Finland sedan tidigare anpassa sig, lära sig och ge akt på sina attityder.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-integration/narration/resume-20261103T063708681338+0000-4/hb-c12-u0011-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.613061224489796, "peak": 0.40069580078125, "generation_seconds": 31.448991453973576, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
